schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-env-sunken-market
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art of the Sunken Market — Zone 2 of the Twilight Zone. A flooded
    bazaar with chest-deep water that is not water but liquid shadow — dark, slightly viscous,
    reflecting light in wrong directions. Market stalls rise from the shadow-water at various
    heights, their awnings tattered and dripping, goods still displayed on shelves but
    half-submerged and rotting. Spices, fabrics, pottery, brass lanterns — all slowly being
    consumed by the dark tide. Bioluminescent fish swim through the shadow-water, their
    teal-green glow creating an eerie underlighting that illuminates the market from below,
    casting strange rippling light patterns on the undersides of stalls and awnings. Tarnished
    copper fixtures — lanterns, scales, decorative plates — catch the reflected teal light and
    add warm corroded accents. The color palette is teal and tarnished copper dominating, with
    deep indigo shadows. Walkways are narrow stone bridges between stalls, partially submerged.
    Floating debris — wooden crates, tangled cloth, lost offerings — drifts slowly. The
    atmosphere is drowned commerce, a marketplace that was swallowed whole. Painterly style,
    atmospheric lighting with the primary light source being the bioluminescent glow from
    below. The mood is melancholy abundance — everything you could want, permanently out of
    reach beneath dark water.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, clear water, blue water, sunny market, colorful palette, tropical, bright teal, clean copper, low detail, flat shading"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: "3:2"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    atmosphere: {weight: 3, description: "Mood matches prompt — dark, corrupted, liminal space feeling"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Depth and spatial structure readable, foreground-midground-background layers"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key architectural/environmental details from prompt present"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Dark fantasy painterly style, chiaroscuro lighting, indigo-amber palette"}
  reject_if:
    - "bright sunlight or cheerful atmosphere"
    - "modern or clean architecture"
    - "cartoon or anime style"

tags: [environment, zone-2, market, flooded, bazaar, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
